hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1268","The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) used to observe I`tikaf in the last ten days of Ramadan. [Al-Bukhari and Muslim] ."
"1269","On the authority of Aisha, may Allah be pleased with her, that the Prophet (ﷺ) used to seclude himself during the last ten days of Ramadan, until Allah Almighty took his life, and then his wives did seclusion after him. [Al-Bukhari and Muslim]"
"1270","The Prophet (ﷺ) used to observe I'tikaf every year (during Ramadan) for ten days; in the year in which he passed away, he observed I'tikaf for twenty days. [Al-Bukhari] ."
